meta {
  name: 06 Auth
  seq: 7
}

auth {
  mode: basic
}

auth:basic {
  username: folder
  password: inherit
}

docs {
  # Auth
  
  Every auth mode must work over h2. **Watch Basic auth closely.** axios hands credentials to Node's `http.ClientRequest` (the `auth` option), and the h2 transport never sees that, so Bruno builds the `Authorization` header itself. Timeline line: `HTTP/2: Authorization header built from auth option / URL credentials`.
}
